      (disableBackgroundJobs / disableReadHealthDataHistory), matching the
      Cordova plugin's DisableBackgroundJobs / DisableReadHealthDataHistory
      preferences, and Android manifest merging has no equivalent conditional
      mechanism for a plugin's own static declarations. See android/NOTES.md.
